{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:41885578ac879bdf","name":"Duwani Mechanical Products","source":{"id":"source:reference-41885578ac879bdf","title":"Duwani Mechanical Products","revision":24491,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:32:05Z","sha256":"e8d1a1b1dd475d391f97088d9a78bfc019f12a86bf9741c63056d55d5c896a18","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24491","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Duwani%20Mechanical%20Products&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-41885578ac879bdf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Operating 4,000 years before the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},", Duwani Mechanical Products is among the more successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Manufacturers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Manufacturers","referenceId":"reference:41c1bfb8b5b00c0a"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic_Era"},". Duwani products span the range of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," market, including Service Droids and early Battle Droids. Duwani's Droids are durable and rugged-looking. Although elegant models exist, Duwani's design style is utilitarian and minimalist. Duwani Battle Droids fight for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", and its Service and Protocol Droids are commonly found at Republic and commercial facilities around the galaxy. The reliability of its units and its superior customer service make Duwani a major competitor of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Czerka Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Czerka_Corporation","referenceId":"reference:cf6b7a4dee7c0713"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," market.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Once per encounter, when it has half or fewer of its maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", a Duwani Droid can either gain 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," or add 5 to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," for one round.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
